# The daukle checkout the harness builds against, at the ROOT only. Unanchored this matches
# at every depth, and it silently swallowed wrapper-bootstrap/.daukle/wrapper.toml: present
# locally, absent from a clone, and the wrapper then reports a missing pin file in CI alone.
# `build/` is left unanchored on purpose, because no example here keeps a tracked build/.
/.daukle/
test/.work/
build/
node_modules/
site/
